     3,
     "<div bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\"><div><br>On Mar 12, 2013, at 9:02 PM, Joe Cheng &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">j...@rstudio.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br><br></div><div></div><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\">Thanks. Any idea why they are blocking that server?</div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Tue, Mar 12, 2013 at 5:20 PM, Kati Illouz <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">kil...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br>\r\n\r\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div>Thank you for your assistance.</div><div><br></div><div>After much investigation, it turns out that the proxy server at my workplace blocks access to <a href=\"http://cdn.sockjs.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cdn.sockjs.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792409606836000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3CupI-gAH6UDIsBpT-4sJ4\">http://cdn.sockjs.org</a>. Hence this is the reason why no output is being returned by shiny web applications while I am connected to my work&#39;s network.</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br></div><div>Thanks again.</div><div>Kati</div><br><div><div><div><div>On Mar 11, 2013, at 1:34 AM, Joe Cheng &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">j...@rstudio.com</a>&gt; wrote:</div><br>\r\n\r\n</div></div><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div><div><div dir=\"ltr\">I can only imagine that <a href=\"http://cdn.sockjs.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cdn.sockjs.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792409606836000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3CupI-gAH6UDIsBpT-4sJ4\">http://cdn.sockjs.org</a> was down momentarily. Can you try reloading your browser and try again?<div>\r\n\r\n<br></div><div>If that doesn&#39;t work, can you go to <a href=\"http://cdn.sockjs.org/sockjs-0.3.min.js\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cdn.sockjs.org/sockjs-0.3.min.js&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792409606836000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1lkkFp6quPzWeFHsAspdgt\">http://cdn.sockjs.org/sockjs-0.3.min.js</a> in the same browser and tell us what&#39;s in the first few lines?</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Sun, Mar 10, 2013 at 5:45 PM, Kati Illouz <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">kil...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>I directed myself to the shiny web page <a href=\"http://www.rstudio.com/shiny/\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:purple;text-decoration:underline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.rstudio.com/shiny/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792409606836000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3e6TEVOLamyPrWRjVhvxmf\">http://www.rstudio.com/shiny/</a> using Internet Explorer 8. The attached jpg file is a screen capture showing how no output is being returned by the example web application provided on the page. Furthermore, please find below a log of the webpage errors that I have encountered while visiting this site.</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div><br></div><div>Any guidance in resolving these errors would be great.</div><div><br></div><div>I am extremely excited and appreciated about what Shiny has to offer.</div><div><br></div><div>THanks.</div><div>Kati<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div><div style=\"line-height:normal;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt\"><u></u><u></u></div><div style=\"line-height:normal;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<u></u> <u></u></div><div style=\"line-height:normal;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;margin:0in 0in